  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div> <div id=\"animated-custom-banner\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"container-5951ae5100\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <p> <h2> A new beginning. </h2> </p> </div>\n\n<div id=\"container-08a30202bd\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\"> <p><span>Introducing the NVIDIA RTX Spark™ Superchip. The fusion of NVIDIA AI and RTX graphics in a single chip redefines Windows PCs and delivers amazing creating, AI development, and gaming—on the slimmest, most beautiful RTX laptops ever and small, ultra-efficient desktops.</span></p> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"rtx-spark-superchip\" data-cmp-desktopretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-platform-full-viewport-desktop-1440@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-desktopimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-platform-full-viewport-desktop-1440.jpg\" data-cmp-laptopretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-platform-full-viewport-tablet-1440@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-laptopimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-platform-full-viewport-laptop-1440.jpg\" data-cmp-tabletretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-platform-full-viewport-tablet-1440@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-tabletimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-platform-full-viewport-tablet-1440.jpg\" data-cmp-mobileretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-platform-full-viewport-phone-2000@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-mobileimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-platform-full-viewport-phone-2000.jpg\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"container-a4847776fc\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <p> <h2> Mind and Muscle—All in One </h2> </p> </div> <div id=\"container-7fc4ad0660\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\"> <div id=\"container-914d4d42f7\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <p> <h3> 6,144 Core </h3> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"container-925219bc60\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <p> <h3> 20 Core </h3> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"container-ede4ad5cfc\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <p> <h3> 1 Petaflop </h3> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"container-c0459dfb97\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <p> <h3> 128 GB </h3> </p> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"container-3076003868\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\"> <div id=\"container-4e2a3bd02f\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"nv-title-cb914c1a64\"> <p> <h3> Built for Agents and AI </h3> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"nv-text-8d4ea46131\"> <p>CUDA, the software that accelerates the world’s AI, runs natively on RTX Spark.</p> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"container-e769f50f89\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"nv-title-8865210d34\"> <p> <h3> All-Day Battery Life </h3> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"nv-text-cd9f0db48b\"> <p>The most power-efficient RTX chip ever made, in a chassis so slim you'll forget you’re carrying it.</p> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"container-567ea985c3\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"nv-title-8e2df3ac69\"> <p> <h3> Creator Crafted </h3> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"nv-text-6e4693c269\"> <p>Make a million ideas happen with hundreds of creative apps and AI tools supercharged by RTX and <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/studio/\">NVIDIA Studio</a> tools.</p> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"container-3e8e213036\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"nv-title-a0ed54ab28\"> <p> <h3> Game Ready </h3> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"nv-text-5bb1ee6fff\"> <p>Play the latest and greatest games with world-leading gaming tech. Ray-traced worlds, the full DLSS suite, NVIDIA Reflex, and G-SYNC.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"container-111d01e7c8\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\"> <div id=\"nv-title-8a62ef7469\"> <p> <h2> Your PC Just Went From Tool to Teammate </h2> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"nv-text-877398b94f\"> <p><span>Welcome to the PC where agents work alongside you—running tasks, generating assets, writing code, on demand. You set the objective. The machine handles the rest. There’s intelligence on both sides of the keyboard now.</span></p> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"make-code-play\" data-cmp-desktopretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-motif-full-viewport-desktop-1440@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-desktopimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-motif-full-viewport-desktop-1440.jpg\" data-cmp-laptopretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-motif-full-viewport-laptop-1800@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-laptopimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-motif-full-viewport-laptop-1800.jpg\" data-cmp-tabletretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-motif-full-viewport-tablet-2500@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-tabletimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-motif-full-viewport-tablet-2500.jpg\" data-cmp-mobileretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-motif-full-viewport-phone-3000@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-mobileimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-motif-full-viewport-phone-3000.jpg\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"nv-title-a1622b07d8\"> <p> <h2> Make More, Code More, Play More </h2> </p> </div>\n\n<div id=\"container-d3e4e97673\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\"> <div id=\"nv-teaser-bc56a650b2\" data-title-style=\"manual\" data-rendition-thumbnail.140.100=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-creators-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.thumbnail.140.100.png\" data-rendition-thumbnail.48.48=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-creators-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.thumbnail.48.48.png\" data-rendition-original=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-creators-1080x1440.jpg\" data-rendition-web.1280.1280=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-creators-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1280.1280.jpeg\" data-rendition-thumbnail.319.319=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-creators-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.thumbnail.319.319.png\"> <p><span>Creators</span></p> <h3 data-titlerow=\"One\" data-titlerowlaptop=\"One\" data-titlerowtablet=\"One\"> Your Creative Power, Unlocked </h3> <p>Every creative workflow gets its own accelerator. FP4 Tensor Cores and unified memory for the latest models. RT Cores plus DLSS for real-time 3D renders. 4:2:2 hardware encode and decode for native, color-accurate timelines. AV1 encoders and <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/broadcasting/broadcast-app/\">NVIDIA Broadcast</a> for sharper streams and cleaner audio.</p> </div>\n<div id=\"nv-teaser-f030544970\" data-title-style=\"manual\" data-rendition-thumbnail.140.100=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-developers-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.thumbnail.140.100.png\" data-rendition-thumbnail.48.48=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-developers-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.thumbnail.48.48.png\" data-rendition-original=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-developers-1080x1440.jpg\" data-rendition-web.1280.1280=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-developers-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1280.1280.jpeg\" data-rendition-thumbnail.319.319=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-developers-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.thumbnail.319.319.png\"> <p><span>Developers</span></p> <h3 data-titlerow=\"One\" data-titlerowlaptop=\"One\" data-titlerowtablet=\"One\"> The AI Standard </h3> <p>The same NVIDIA CUDA® stack the world’s AI is built on, so you can develop and prototype on the same machine. And with up to 128 GB of unified memory, you can prototype, fine-tune, and inference on the latest models locally.</p> </div>\n<div id=\"nv-teaser-08e0af2046\" data-title-style=\"manual\" data-rendition-thumbnail.140.100=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gamers-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.thumbnail.140.100.png\" data-rendition-thumbnail.48.48=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gamers-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.thumbnail.48.48.png\" data-rendition-original=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gamers-1080x1440.jpg\" data-rendition-web.1280.1280=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gamers-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1280.1280.jpeg\" data-rendition-thumbnail.319.319=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gamers-1080x1440.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.thumbnail.319.319.png\"> <p><span>Gamers</span></p> <h3 data-titlerow=\"One\" data-titlerowlaptop=\"One\" data-titlerowtablet=\"One\"> Game Ready </h3> <p>Experience the latest and greatest games with RTX. Ray-traced lighting for incredible immersion. The full suite of <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/technologies/dlss/\">DLSS</a> technologies. Game-winning responsiveness with <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/technologies/reflex/\">NVIDIA Reflex</a>. The hardware that defined modern PC gaming, ready to play.</p> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"container-5828661e4a\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"nv-title-73d68ab711\"> <p> <h2> Over 1,000 Accelerated Apps and Games, Millions of Ways to Use Them </h2> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"nv-text-ff5add6ca7\"> <p><span>RTX brings you exclusive features and the latest advancements in AI, simulation, and ray tracing. Experience incredible 3D performance, smoother video editing, photorealistic simulations, and stunning visuals in the apps, AI tools, and games that pros, creators, and gamers use every day.</span></p> </div> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"premium-inside-out\" data-cmp-desktopretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gallery-bm-xl770-offset-center-d@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-desktopimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gallery-bm-xl770-offset-center-d.jpg\" data-cmp-laptopretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gallery-bm-xl770-offset-center-l@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-laptopimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gallery-bm-xl770-offset-center-l.jpg\" data-cmp-tabletretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gallery-bbm-xl550-offset-t@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-tabletimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gallery-bbm-xl550-offset-t.jpg\" data-cmp-mobileretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gallery-bm-xl-fhm-550-p@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-mobileimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-gallery-bm-xl-fhm-550-p.jpg\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <p> <h2> Premium Inside and Out </h2> </p> </div>\n<div id=\"container-06370f7c90\" data-cmp-desktopretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-desktop-pcs-bm-xl905-offset-center-d@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-desktopimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-desktop-pcs-bm-xl905-offset-center-d.jpg\" data-cmp-laptopretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-desktop-pcs-bm-xl770-offset-center-l@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-laptopimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-desktop-pcs-bm-xl770-offset-center-l.jpg\" data-cmp-tabletretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-desktop-pcs-bm-xl650-offset-t@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-tabletimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-desktop-pcs-bm-xl650-offset-t.jpg\" data-cmp-mobileretinaimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-desktop-pcs-bm-xl-fhm-725-p@2x.jpg\" data-cmp-mobileimage=\"/content/dam/en-zz/nvidiaweb/products/rtx-spark/nvidia-rtx-spark-desktop-pcs-bm-xl-fhm-725-p.jpg\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"nv-title-c6037f8a02\"> <p> <h2> Small Footprint. Big Performance. </h2> </p> </div>\n\n<div id=\"nv-text-698aabaf3a\"> <p><span>Get RTX Spark in a small, ultra-efficient desktop. Built to run personal AI agents 24/7 right at your desk plus game and create with the full power of RTX graphics. </span></p> </div> </div>\n<div id=\"container-b73e1c78d3\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-container\" data-cmp-breadcrumbcolor=\"none\"> <div id=\"nv-text-a86d75f98f\"> <p><span>Sign up to be notified when RTX Spark Laptops and Desktops are available.</span></p> </div> <div id=\"nv-text-d1957b3874\"> <p><span><span>©2026 NVIDIA Corporation. All rights reserved. NVIDIA and the NVIDIA logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of NVIDIA Corporation in the U.S. and other countries. Other company and product names may be trademarks of the respective companies with which they are associated.</span></span></p> </div> </div>\n<div data-form-page-path=\"/content/forms/af/nvidia-forms/products/n1x-notify-me-form\" id=\"notify-me\" data-cmp-is=\"nv-modal\"> <p id=\"aem-form-title\"> <h2>Email Me When Available</h2> </p> <!-- This is to ensure that the there is no WCM Mode cookie when AF 